## 1. What Was Changed

### New file — `src/public/api.js`

A shared fetch utility used by every page. It:
- Always attaches `credentials: "include"` so the httpOnly JWT cookie is sent.
- Redirects to `/auth/SignIn.html` automatically on a 401 response.
- Returns `null` (instead of throwing) when the server returns a non-OK status, so each page can handle empty states without crashing.

Every HTML page now loads `api.js` before its own script, giving access to the `api.get/post/put/delete` helpers.

