Added `authenticateJWT` middleware to the two posture routes that were missing it:

```js
// BEFORE — req.user was always undefined
app.get("/api/posture/latest", getLatest);
app.get("/api/posture/stream", streamPosture);

// AFTER — req.user is populated from the JWT cookie
app.get("/api/posture/latest", authenticateJWT, getLatest);
app.get("/api/posture/stream", authenticateJWT, streamPosture);
```

